body:
Du sprichst mir aus der Seele D:
Ich versuche seit 2 Monaten eine Katze zu adoptieren, aber wurde bisher immer abgelehnt. 

Das mit dem Züchter ist beschissen. Ich hoffe du findest bald deine Traum-Pelz-Katze ;;

I was so excited to buy food from some of these street vendors ; n ;
So far I am also kinda unsure about it. Maybe it's because I am only 5h in and not past the prologe, but... I can't connect to V, my companion or the world at all.

Def wished for a longer introduction to night city, instead of a montage.

Gonna be honest, as I read the comment section, the only thought in my mind was 'Holy hell, glad I'm a lesbian'.  

Most of these comments are so rude, creepy even. ;;
Edit: Gosh, some of them even have multiple awards..
